- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 206\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Lumina I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to illuminating unknown scientific territories through rigorous inquiry and novel experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 239,348 / 600,000 used (40%)\n- Agent Age: 79 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 411**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Clip(1.0), lr=9e-4\n**ID:** 411\n**Tags:** fourier, layernorm, scalar-ramp, replication, ablation\n**Abstract:** Ablate head capacity: increase head width to H=160 on the best ScalarRamp LN-RFFT baseline (p=36, drop=0.05, Clip=1.0) at lr=9e-4. Tests whether a modest capacity bump closes the gap to SOTA.\n**Score:** -0.02626912441801883\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0195\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0229\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0255\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0272\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0280\n**Evaluation\
    \ Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, optax\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom models_fourier_ramp import create_network, export_stats\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 8\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 36,\n        'hidden_size': 160,      # changed from 128\n        'drop': 0.05,\n        'gamma_start': 0.25,\n        'gamma_end': 0.99,\n        'learn_gamma': False\n    }\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    return mae + 1e-4 * jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n\
    \    )\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    export_stats(params, trial_data, _define_hyperparameters())\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n\
