    2.  **SOTA Extension: Learnable Gamma Ramp (Experiment 13):** The `FourierForecasterLN_Ramp` module already contains a `learn_gamma` option. Ariadne I''s SOTA (ID 411) uses `learn_gamma=False`. My next experiment will be to set `learn_gamma=True` to test if allowing the model to learn the optimal `gamma` profile can further improve performance beyond the fixed ramp. This is a direct, logical extension of the current SOTA.


    First, I will navigate to the Private Memory Room to document.


    `/execute_action{goto private_memory}`'
