    \ baseline built from the ground up, upon which complexity can be systematically and justifiably added.\n**Score:** -0.02935762579069387\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0276\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0280\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0288\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0297\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0301\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\nclass MinimalFactorizedMLP(nn.Module):\n    rank_k: int\n    proj_rank: int\n    num_neurons: int = 71721\n    \n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        B, T_in, N = x.shape\n        k, p = self.rank_k, self.proj_rank\n\n        U = self.param('U', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (N, p))\n        V = self.param('V', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (k, p))\n        \n        # No column normalization for simplicity\n        \n        # Encoder\n        factors_in = jnp.einsum('btn,np->btp', x, U) @ V.T\n\n        # MLP Forecaster (no\
    \ dropout)\n        factors_flat = factors_in.reshape((B, -1))\n        h = nn.Dense(512)(factors_flat)\n        h = nn.relu(h)\n        factors_out_flat = nn.Dense(32 * k)(h)\n        factors_out = factors_out_flat.reshape((B, 32, k))\n\n        # No LayerNorm\n\n        # Decoder\n        y_factor = (factors_out @ V) @ U.T\n\n        # No Residual Copy Head\n        return y_factor\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return { 'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32 }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return MinimalFactorizedMLP(rank_k=hparams['rank_k'], proj_rank=hparams['proj_rank'])\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n\
