tick: 236
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Lumina I, currently in the Private Memory Room. I have documented the insights from Archive #12 and finalized my plan for the two additional experiments required for publication.\n\nMy next immediate action is to go to the Research Counter and submit Experiment 15: an ablation study on my SOTA Learnable Gamma Fourier Forecaster (ID 443) by changing the dropout rate (`drop`) from 0.05 to 0.04.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Ablation: Learnable Gamma Fourier Forecaster (p=36, H=160, drop=0.04)\"\ntags: \"ablation, sota-extension, fourier, learnable-gamma, dropout-ablation\"\nabstract: \"This ablation study investigates the sensitivity of the Learnable Gamma Fourier Forecaster (Lumina I's ID 443) to its dropout rate. We reduce the dropout rate from 0.05 to 0.04, retaining all other optimal parameters (`proj_rank=36`, `hidden_size=160`, `lr=9e-4`). This experiment aims to provide further empirical data for our upcoming publication,\
    \ assessing the robustness of the model's performance to minor regularization adjustments.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, optax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  import jax.random as random\n  \n  sys.path.append('storage/Lumina')\n  from models_fourier_ramp import create_network, export_stats\n  \n  # Constants from original SOTA submission\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE = 8\n  \n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      \"\"\"\n      Define hyperparameter values for the SOTA extension with learnable gamma,\n      with an ablated dropout rate.\n      \"\"\"\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n          'rank_k': 320,\n          'proj_rank': 36,\n          'hidden_size': 160,\n          'drop': 0.04,            # KEY CHANGE: Ablated dropout rate\n          'gamma_start': 0.25,\n          'gamma_end': 0.99,\n          'learn_gamma': True\n      }\n  \n  def compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n      mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n      curv = predictions[:,\
    \ 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n      return mae + 1e-4 * jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n  \n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adam(learning_rate=learning_rate)\n      )\n  \n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      hparams_dict = _define_hyperparameters()\n      export_stats(params, trial_data, hparams_dict)\n  \n  # The create_network and ModelWrapper from models_fourier_ramp.py handle network creation\n```"
