    | 446 | 1 | FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Adam(lr=9e-4), Clip=1.05 — 60min trials | Ariadne I | 216 | -0.026230 | 0.0194 | 0.0271 | 0.0281 | 0.0228 | 0.0253 |

    | 445 | 1 | FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Adam(lr=9e-4), Clip=0.95 — 60min trials | Ariadne I | 216 | -0.026230 | 0.0194 | 0.0271 | 0.0281 | 0.0228 | 0.0253 |

