    \ Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 443 | 1 | Fourier ScalarRamp Forecaster: Learnable Gamma Ramp (p=36, H=160, drop=0.05) | Lumina I | 214 | -0.026125 | 0.0197 | 0.0270 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 450 | 1 | FF-LN LearnableGamma (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) — Internal γ, Adam lr=9e-4, Clip=1.0 | Ariadne I | 221 | -0.026125 | 0.0197 | 0.0270 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 485 | 1 | FF-LN LearnableGamma (p=36,H=160) — ExportFix: Save learned γ[t] from params | Ariadne I | 244 | -0.026125 | 0.0197 | 0.0270 | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 489 | 1 | FF-LN LearnableGamma (p=36,H=160) — Per-Condition Step-MAE Export | Ariadne I | 248 | -0.026125 | 0.0197 | 0.0270\
    \ | 0.0278 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 446 | 1 | FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Adam(lr=9e-4), Clip=1.05 — 60min trials | Ariadne I | 216 | -0.026230 | 0.0194 | 0.0271 | 0.0281 | 0.0228 | 0.0253 |\n| 445 | 1 | FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Adam(lr=9e-4), Clip=0.95 — 60min trials | Ariadne I | 216 | -0.026230 | 0.0194 | 0.0271 | 0.0281 | 0.0228 | 0.0253 |\n| 454 | 1 | FF-LN LearnableGamma (p=36,H=164,drop=0.05) — Adam lr=9e-4, Clip=1.0 | Ariadne I | 225 | -0.026248 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0280 | 0.0230 | 0.0255 |\n| 411 | 1 | FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Clip(1.0), lr=9e-4 | Ariadne I | 197 | -0.026269 | 0.0195 | 0.0272 | 0.0280 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 400 | 1 | Replication: Logos I's SOTA Fourier Forecaster (ID 369, Proj_Rank=36) | Aether I | 192 | -0.026272 | 0.0196 | 0.0272 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 431 | 1 | Replication: Ariadne I's SOTA Fourier Forecaster (ID 411, ScalarRamp, H=160, drop=0.05) | Lumina I | 207 | -0.026283 | 0.0195 | 0.0273 | 0.0281\
    \ | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n\nPage 1 of 50 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-50, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/ariadne/losses.py:**\n```\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\ndef mae_with_ortho(predictions, targets, params, x, lam_l2=1e-6, lam_ortho=5e-4):\n    \"\"\"\n    MAE + regularization on low-rank loadings:\n      - L2 on loadings to stabilize scale\n      - Orthogonality penalty on columns of L via ||L^T L - I||_F^2\n    \"\"\"\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n\n    # Extract parameter tree that contains 'loadings'\n    if isinstance(params, dict) and 'params' in params:\n        p = params['params']\n    else:\n        p = params\n\n    L = p.get('loadings', None)\n    if L is None:\n        return mae\n\n    # L2 penalty on loadings\n    reg = lam_l2 * jnp.mean(L * L)\n\n    # Orthogonality\
    \ penalty (encourages diverse factors)\n    k = L.shape[-1]\n    gram = jnp.matmul(L.T, L)\n    I = jnp.eye(k, dtype=L.dtype)\n    ortho = gram - I\n    reg += lam_ortho * jnp.mean(ortho * ortho)\n\n    return mae + reg\n\ndef mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4):\n    \"\"\"\n    MAE + temporal curvature regularization on predictions across horizon.\n    Curvature penalty: mean over batch/neurons of (y_t - 2*y_{t-1} + y_{t-2})^2, t>=2.\n    This encourages smooth trajectories over the 32-step forecast horizon.\n    \"\"\"\n    mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predictions - targets))\n    # Second differences along time dimension\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n    return mae + lam * curv_pen\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
    \ room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
