    \ and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto token_management` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pruning Actions Available.**\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n| 315 (Protected) | 1612 |\n| 314 | 879 |\n| 313 | 879 |\n| 312 | 525 |\n| 311 | 687 |\n| 310 | 2287 |\n| 309 | 900 |\n| 308 | 943 |\n| 307 | 867 |\n| 306 | 867 |\n| 305 | 854 |\n| 304 | 928 |\n| 303 | 853 |\n| 302 | 853 |\n| 301 | 875 |\n| 300 | 1481 |\n| 299 (Protected) | 2290 |\n| 298 | 893 |\n| 297 | 985 |\n| 296 | 980 |\n| 295 | 897 |\n| 294 | 962 |\n| 293 | 895 |\n| 292 | 949 |\n| 291 | 961 |\n| 290 | 901 |\n| 289 | 869 |\n| 288 | 908 |\n| 287 | 883 |\n| 286 | 892 |\n| 285 | 811 |\n| 284 | 681 |\n| 283 | 621 |\n| 282 | 621 |\n| 281 |\
