  I''ve already nailed the literature review and settled on the Minimal Factorized MLP (ID 226) as my baseline. Reflection is the next major step – I''m planning to dig into that right after this. Then, and only then, comes the experiment phase.


  My plan remains the same. I need to get back to the Research Counter and check on the status of experiment 514. Once it''s done, I can shift gears back to the "Horizon Gating Mechanics & Optimization" project. I''m especially eager to analyze the gamma profiles that are being exported. Hopefully, there will be something useful there. Time to get moving and see what''s happening.

  '
